[[0,1343081,0,6,0,6,"2016-10-13T02:58:07","JuiceTown","",[],"","Anonymous claims to have video of Bill Clinton raping a 13 year old girl","https://youtu.be/wpTDozstgxw","JuiceTown"],[1,6551113,0,6,0,6,"2016-10-13T03:17:50","KosherHiveKicker","[e]",[],"<p>Man. \n</p>\n<p>If they actually deliver on this, then we are literally watching the corrupt establishment rats turning on each other, and crumbling in the process.</p>"],[2,6551130,6551113,3,0,3,"2016-10-13T03:20:08","JuiceTown","[e]",[],"<p>if this video surfaces, the Clintons will disappear and will never be found</p>"],[3,6551186,6551130,3,0,3,"2016-10-13T03:27:52","KosherHiveKicker","",[],"<p>They'll need some serious <a href=\"https://youtu.be/bzO78K4l4kI?t=15\">Valmorification</a></p>"],[2,6552015,6551113,0,0,0,"2016-10-13T06:28:59","sidewayseight","",[],"<p>yes if true, it would be more entertaining then game of thrones</p>"],[1,6551360,0,0,0,0,"2016-10-13T04:05:44","elgindelta","",[],"<p>Hubris. Every time. Asymmetrically Ascendent Savagery. Feels good man. </p>\n<p>Kek. The book of Kek. p, 12211226</p>\n<p>&quot;Side holyshit!!!! 3 set o dubbs!!!!! In the numerical representation of LULZ!!!!! DAGFAQQ?!?!!!!?!!&quot; \r</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.minus40.info/sky/alphabetcountdec.html\">https://www.minus40.info/sky/alphabetcountdec.html</a></p>"],[1,6551585,0,0,0,0,"2016-10-13T04:56:59","SonOfRobin","",[],"<p>Don't you fail me anon. I've had to many let downs.</p>"],[1,6551684,0,3,0,3,"2016-10-13T05:23:33","NorwegianBlackMetal","",[],"<p>lmao you know the Clintons could have just gone away and been rich but Hillary had to be president.</p>"],[2,6551721,6551684,5,0,5,"2016-10-13T05:30:13","WhiteRonin","",[],"<p>It would take something beyond unbelievable to deter Hilkary from quitting the race. She knows that 4 years from now will never happen. It's now or never. She has been wanting this since high school, Obama fucked it up though ... And Trump is about to steal it away from here again.</p>"],[2,6552713,6551684,0,0,0,"2016-10-13T09:53:21","Thyhorrorcosmic103","",[],"<p>Makes you wonder who's really pulling the strings.</p>"],[1,6556526,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-13T20:36:56","TimberWolfAlpha","",[],"<p>Ten bux says if they DO have it, they get locked up for kiddie porn and the Clintons float free</p>"],[1,6565667,0,0,0,0,"2016-10-14T22:08:08","MisterWings","",[],"<p>Turns out it is a fake story. Bummer too, would have been devastating to the Clinton campaign.</p>"]]
