[[0,1343093,0,2,0,2,"2016-10-13T03:03:26","0x4F","",[],"","Actor David Oyelowo criticizes Game of Thrones for lack of ethnic minorities: \"The future needs to be more colorful than the past\"","http://www.dailymail.co.uk/tvshowbiz/article-3834988/We-hope-future-colourful-past-David-Oyelowo-criticises-Game-Thrones-lack-ethnic-minority-characters.html","tv"],[1,6551103,0,6,0,6,"2016-10-13T03:14:50","Firevine","",[],"<p>How about you go make your own &quot;colorful&quot; show then you dumb fuck </p>"],[1,6551107,0,9,0,9,"2016-10-13T03:16:41","bfriend13","",[],"<p>Then he should produce his own shows and pack them with whatever he wants. </p>"],[1,6552692,0,2,0,2,"2016-10-13T09:46:33","argeek","",[],"<p>Fuck him and everybody that looks like him. </p>"],[1,6554188,0,2,0,2,"2016-10-13T15:13:12","con77","",[],"<p>You know why there were no muslims on Star Trek? Because it was in the future!</p>"],[1,7087853,0,2,0,2,"2016-12-06T09:41:37","jimmyrussel","",[],"<p>What show was he fucking watching? Almost everyone on the Eastern continent was non white.</p>\n<p>The entire Dothraki, the population of Qarth... oh wait he means more black characters. East Asians, Arabs and Eastern Europeans don't count as minorities anymore.</p>\n<p>Westeros is well... modeled after Britain. Look at a map of Britain and stick on the head of Spain at the bottom, that's Westeros. Starks are Scots, Iron Isles are Irish, Lannisters (<em>cough</em> Lancasters) are Welsh... and Kings landing is London. It's a fantasy version of the war of the roses. He's complaining that there's no black people of note in 15th century English Civil War history... </p>"],[1,7567123,0,0,0,0,"2017-01-10T17:34:42","Inque_Yutani","[e]",[],"<p>The future?</p>\n<p>Uh, the show does not take place on Earth. We don't have weird, varying winters. It's relationship to our time or world is undefined. The world outside Westeros is clearly not white.</p>\n<p>This is just Glom On To Popular Thing tactic. If I were running the show, I'd bring in a black slave race that tries to revolt, but gets their asses handed to them.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com/736x/93/b8/9c/93b89c93c6296676b12947730fc8e1de.jpg\">Zim gets last word</a></p>"]]
